--TEST--
a property typed as an array keyed by an enum shows both type arguments on hover, the enum key first, `rule:ide/the-request-set-is-closed`, `rule:types/arrays`
--FILE--
<?nvs
enum Priority { Low, Normal, High }

class Labels
{
    public array<Priority, string> $names = [];
}

var $l = new Labels();
echo $l->na<|>mes[Priority::Low];
--REQUEST--
hover
--EXPECT--
```nvs
array<Priority, string>
```
